{"title":"Career Roadmap · Healthcare UX Designer","role":"Healthcare UX Designer","summary":"A Healthcare UX Designer designs digital experiences for patients, doctors, nurses, caregivers, administrators and other healthcare users. The role combines UX research, interaction design, accessibility, healthcare workflows, information architecture, clinical context, data privacy and usability to make healthcare technology safer, clearer and easier to use.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Healthcare / Medical Product Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Healthcare UX Designer designs digital experiences for patients, doctors, nurses, caregivers, administrators and other healthcare users. The role combines UX research, interaction design, accessibility, healthcare workflows, information architecture, clinical context, data privacy and usability to make healthcare technology safer, clearer and easier to use."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Healthcare/Medical Product Design","Healthcare UX Internship","Junior UX Designer","Healthcare UX Designer","Senior Healthcare/Product Designer","Lead/Staff Designer","Design Manager / Head of Design"],"label":"Typical route"},{"type":"p","text":"Healthcare is a high-stakes design environment. A good healthcare UX designer must design for clarity, accessibility, safety, privacy and clinical workflow, not just visual appeal."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Years","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"UX fundamentals + healthcare context"}],[{"text":"Exploration"},{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Research, workflows and interaction design"}],[{"text":"Product Development"},{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"Healthcare applications and usability"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"UX Intern / Junior UX Designer"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Healthcare UX/Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Complex clinical and patient systems"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"2037–2040"},{"text":"Senior/Lead Healthcare Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Strategic"},{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Design Manager / Head of Healthcare Design"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — UX & Healthcare Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong foundation in human-centred design."},{"type":"h","text":"UX fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human-centred design"},{"text":"Design thinking"},{"text":"UX research"},{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Personas"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Wireframing"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Usability testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visual design"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Layout"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Iconography"},{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Responsive design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the basic healthcare ecosystem:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patients"},{"text":"Doctors"},{"text":"Nurses"},{"text":"Caregivers"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Clinics"},{"text":"Laboratories"},{"text":"Pharmacies"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Telemedicine"},{"text":"Electronic health records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important mindset"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare UX is not simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Make the app easy to use.\""},{"type":"h","text":"It is:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Make the right information understandable and the right action possible at the right time, with minimal risk of error.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"FigJam"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Miro"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Healthcare UX Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Move into healthcare-specific user experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn healthcare workflows"},{"type":"h","text":"Map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient registration"},{"text":"Appointment booking"},{"text":"Consultation"},{"text":"Prescription"},{"text":"Diagnostic testing"},{"text":"Laboratory workflow"},{"text":"Medication management"},{"text":"Discharge"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Insurance/claims"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UX research"},{"type":"h","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contextual interviews"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Journey mapping"},{"text":"Task analysis"},{"text":"Workflow mapping"},{"text":"Stakeholder interviews"},{"text":"Accessibility testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction design"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Notifications"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Alerts"},{"text":"Data entry"},{"text":"Error prevention"},{"text":"Confirmation flows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare-specific challenge"},{"type":"p","text":"A healthcare interface often contains large amounts of information."},{"type":"h","text":"The designer must determine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["What information is needed","by whom","at what moment","for what decision?"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional Healthcare Product Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on complex healthcare products."},{"type":"h","text":"Design systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Component libraries"},{"text":"Design tokens"},{"text":"Typography systems"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Responsive components"},{"text":"Interaction states"},{"text":"Error states"},{"text":"Empty states"},{"text":"Loading states"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare data"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient demographics"},{"text":"Vital signs"},{"text":"Laboratory results"},{"text":"Medication records"},{"text":"Clinical notes"},{"text":"Appointment data"},{"text":"Diagnostic reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare interoperability awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop conceptual knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HL7"},{"text":"FHIR"},{"text":"DICOM"},{"text":"Healthcare APIs"},{"text":"EHR/EMR systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to become a healthcare software engineer, but understanding how healthcare information moves between systems makes a designer significantly stronger."},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Task completion"},{"text":"Error rates"},{"text":"Time-on-task"},{"text":"User retention"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Patient engagement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"}]},{"type":"p","text":"can be useful."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Industry Readiness"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should demonstrate the ability to design a complete healthcare experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Major Project"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Patient Care Journey Platform\""},{"type":"h","text":"Design a healthcare platform covering:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Discovery","Appointment","Consultation","Diagnostics","Prescription","Follow-up"]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Interview or study appropriate stakeholders such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patients"},{"text":"Caregivers"},{"text":"Doctors"},{"text":"Nurses"},{"text":"Administrative staff"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where direct access is unavailable, use ethically sourced secondary research and clearly document the limitations."},{"type":"h","text":"Deliverables"},{"type":"h","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User personas"},{"text":"Journey maps"},{"text":"Service blueprint"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"User flows"},{"text":"Wireframes"},{"text":"High-fidelity UI"},{"text":"Interactive prototype"},{"text":"Design system"},{"text":"Accessibility evaluation"},{"text":"Usability testing report"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not use real patient-identifiable information in a student project."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Core Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Patient UX"},{"text":"Patient journeys and self-service"}],[{"text":"Clinical UX"},{"text":"Doctor/nurse workflows"}],[{"text":"EHR/EMR UX"},{"text":"Clinical information systems"}],[{"text":"Telehealth UX"},{"text":"Remote consultations"}],[{"text":"Health App UX"},{"text":"Mobile health experiences"}],[{"text":"Medical Device UX"},{"text":"Device interfaces and interaction"}],[{"text":"Healthcare Service Design"},{"text":"End-to-end healthcare journeys"}],[{"text":"Health Data Visualisation"},{"text":"Clinical dashboards"}],[{"text":"Accessibility Design"},{"text":"Inclusive healthcare experiences"}],[{"text":"Digital Therapeutics UX"},{"text":"Behaviour-change products"}],[{"text":"Health Insurance UX"},{"text":"Claims and member journeys"}],[{"text":"Healthcare AI UX"},{"text":"AI-assisted clinical/patient tools"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Health-tech companies"},{"text":"Hospital technology teams"},{"text":"Telemedicine companies"},{"text":"Medical device companies"},{"text":"Digital health startups"},{"text":"Healthcare SaaS companies"},{"text":"Health insurance technology companies"},{"text":"UX/design consultancies"},{"text":"EHR/EMR companies"},{"text":"Public-health technology organisations"}]},{"type":"h","t