},{"text":"User Flows"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Usability Testing"},{"text":"Service Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthcare workflows"},{"text":"Clinical terminology"},{"text":"EHR/EMR"},{"text":"Patient journeys"},{"text":"Healthcare data"},{"text":"Medical-device interaction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Basic HTML/CSS"},{"text":"Basic JavaScript"},{"text":"API concepts"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Standards & Safety"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"WCAG"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"Usability engineering"},{"text":"HL7/FHIR awareness"},{"text":"DICOM awareness"},{"text":"Privacy/security principles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI UX"},{"text":"Conversational UX"},{"text":"Voice interfaces"},{"text":"Wearables"},{"text":"AR/VR"},{"text":"Healthcare AI safety"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Fundamentals + Healthcare Awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Research + Interaction Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clinical Workflows","Design Systems","Usability"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Product Portfolio + Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Years 5–7"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior UX Designer → Healthcare UX Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Years 8–12"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare UX Designer → Senior Product Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Years 12–16"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior → Lead/Staff Healthcare Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Years 16–20"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Lead → Design Manager / Director / Head of Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Best Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong B.Des Healthcare/Medical Product Design graduate targeting Healthcare UX should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong UX research skills"},{"text":"Excellent interaction design"},{"text":"Figma proficiency"},{"text":"Healthcare workflow knowledge"},{"text":"Patient and clinician journey mapping"},{"text":"Usability testing experience"},{"text":"Accessibility knowledge"},{"text":"Design-system experience"},{"text":"Healthcare data visualisation"},{"text":"Basic HTML/CSS/API understanding"},{"text":"HL7/FHIR awareness"},{"text":"3–5 high-quality healthcare UX case studies"},{"text":"At least one clinical workflow project"},{"text":"At least one patient-facing project"},{"text":"Healthcare/health-tech internship"},{"text":"Professional UX portfolio"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Ideal profile","text":"A Healthcare UX Designer who combines human-centred research, interaction and service design with healthcare workflow knowledge, accessibility, usability engineering, data awareness and responsible AI principles to create safe, understandable and effective digital healthcare experiences."}]}]}